        {
          "text": "Naye alipolikaribia lile tundu, akamlilia Danieli kwa sauti ya huzuni; mfalme akanena; akamwambia Danieli, Ee Danieli, mtumishi wa Mungu aliye hai, je! Mungu wako, unayemtumikia daima, aweza kukuponya na simba hawa? ",
