        {
          "text": "Mfalme akaamuru, nao wakawaleta wale watu waliomshitaki Danieli, wakawatupa katika tundu la simba, wao, na watoto wao, na wake zao; na wale simba wakawashinda wakaivunja mifupa yao vipande vipande, kabla hawajafika chini ya tundu.",
